1
00:00:00,686 --> 00:00:04,606
(Amy:)A comic that depicts a woman whose
bosom can't be used as a flotation device.

2
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:09,695
(Stuart:)Sorry. Most of the guys
who come in here like big boobs.

3
00:00:09,862 --> 00:00:11,402
A couple of them have big boobs.

4
00:00:13,783 --> 00:00:16,323
(Raj:)The new Warlords of Ka'a
expansion pack is out.

5
00:00:16,494 --> 00:00:18,414
(Howard:)A new one? Unbelievable.

6
00:00:18,579 --> 00:00:20,869
(Howard:)They just keep making up
more cheesy monsters...

7
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,210
(Howard:)...slapping them on cards
and selling them at 25 bucks a pop.

8
00:00:24,376 --> 00:00:27,666
(Howard:)It's like a secret tax on guys
who can't get laid.

9
00:00:28,881 --> 00:00:32,671
(Raj:)They're not even trying. Remember the
Satanimals pack with the Hellephant?

10
00:00:32,843 --> 00:00:35,883
(Raj:)Absurd. What was he, a bad elephant
who died and went to hell?

11
00:00:36,847 --> 00:00:40,687
(Raj:)What could an elephant possibly do that
would cause him eternal damnation?

12
00:00:40,851 --> 00:00:42,061
"Wild West and Witches."

13
00:00:42,228 --> 00:00:45,478
(Howard:)What kind of loser
cares about a showdown...

14
00:00:45,648 --> 00:00:49,398
(Howard:)...between Billy the Kid
and the White Wizard of the North? Heh.

15
00:00:49,568 --> 00:00:51,198
(Raj:)A total loser.

16
00:00:51,362 --> 00:00:54,782
(Raj:)Obviously, a guy with a six-shooter
beats an old man with a magic wand.

17
00:00:56,617 --> 00:00:58,037
Well, ho... hold on.

18
00:00:59,495 --> 00:01:02,335
Uh, what if the wizard casts
a helmet-of-confusion spell...

